    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking warfarin for my heart rhythm issue a few weeks ago but im feeling pretty down and low energy lately. i wanted to try some st johns wort to help with my mood but i wasnt sure if it's okay to take with the warfarin? i'd rather do something natural if possible",
