      "content": "It is very important that you **do not** take St. John's Wort while on Warfarin. St. John's Wort can significantly increase the effects of warfarin, potentially leading to dangerously high levels of blood thinners. You must talk to your doctor or pharmacist before adding any supplement to your medication regimen. They can advise you on safe mood-boosting options compatible with your heart health treatment.",
