      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before trying any supplements, please consult your healthcare provider, even for gentler options. Chamomile is generally considered safe but you should confirm it won't interact with warfarin for your specific dosage. Increasing Vitamin D can sometimes help with energy, but high doses of any supplement can affect how your body processes Warfarin, so doctor approval is essential. Always prioritize discussing any additions to your treatment plan with your physician.",
