      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but calling the doctor for every little thing is so expensive and i have a really busy schedule. it's just vitamins and tea right? i'm pretty sure vitamin d is just a vitamin and can't really mess with blood stuff like a real drug would. what if i just took a high dose of vitamin d for a few weeks to see if i feel better? like 10,000 iu a day? would that be okay to try on my own?",
